From b3da7a778faf0100e86b3c88df3116dd3b81123e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: egor835 <egor.su.8@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:06:37 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] release: Disable the system selection toolbar

The remote selection toolbar (rendered by SystemUI through a
SurfaceControlViewHost) takes window focus when it's tapped. The app
loses focus, the text selection action mode finishes and the toolbar
is dismissed before the click arrives, so copy/paste/more never work.
Fall back to the in-app floating toolbar.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Iacf2a20720e687f97951298379a4c37aad64cfb9
---
 release/aconfig/cp2a/Android.bp               |  1 +
 .../cp2a/android.permission.flags/Android.bp  | 23 +++++++++++++++++++
 ...tion_toolbar_enabled_flag_values.textproto |  6 +++++
 3 files changed, 30 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 release/aconfig/cp2a/android.permission.flags/Android.bp
 create mode 100644 release/aconfig/cp2a/android.permission.flags/system_selection_toolbar_enabled_flag_values.textproto

